Vendored assets under frontend/public/style/, fetched at commit time (not
at runtime -- docs/WALKMAP.md piece 3 requires no third-party requests from
the built app):

- style.json: OSM Bright GL style, from
  https://github.com/openmaptiles/osm-bright-gl-style (BSD 3-Clause).
  sources/glyphs/sprite were rewritten to local/relative paths (see below);
  no other changes.

- sprite/sprite*.{json,png}: the same OSM Bright style's sprite sheet,
  from https://openmaptiles.github.io/osm-bright-gl-style/sprite* (BSD
  3-Clause, same project as the style).

- glyphs/Noto Sans {Regular,Bold,Italic}/{0-255,256-511}.pbf: SDF glyph
  PBFs for the Noto Sans family (the three "text-font" stacks the style
  uses), fetched from MapLibre's public demo glyph server
  (https://demotiles.maplibre.org/font/), which serves the same
  github.com/openmaptiles/fonts glyph set (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
  Only the Basic Latin + Latin-1 Supplement (0-255) and Latin Extended-A
  (256-511) ranges are kept -- enough for English/Latin place names: the
  full multi-script set is well over the 20MB budget noted in
  docs/WALKMAP.md.

OSM Bright / openmaptiles license text:
https://github.com/openmaptiles/osm-bright-gl-style/blob/master/LICENSE.md

openmaptiles/fonts (OFL) license text:
https://github.com/openmaptiles/fonts/blob/master/noto-sans/LICENSE
